  "body": "Sitting high on the 13th floor of the Spencer on Byron, this beautifully renovated apartment at 9 Byron Avenue, Takapuna, occupies the most coveted corner of the building. It offers spectacular views, all-day sun, and an unbeatable lifestyle, alongside a massive financial upside, having grossed almost $75,000 on Airbnb in the last year alone.\r\n\r\nWith its elevated position, this one bedroom sanctuary captures sweeping views over the Hauraki Gulf and city skyline. Thanks to its prime corner location, natural light floods the property from head to toe. \r\n\r\nIt offers the ultimate lifestyle balance: keep it as your own personal luxury \"bach\" to enjoy whenever you need a beachside getaway, and let it effortlessly generate high-performing short-term rental returns when you aren't there.\r\n\r\nUnlike many in the building, this apartment includes its own dedicated car park, an absolute game-changer in Takapuna that adds tremendous convenience for both you and your guests.\r\n\r\nThe Spencer on Byron is renowned for its resort-style amenities, including a heated pool, spa, gym, and tennis court. Plus, with a 24-hour reception, security, and an unbeatable location just a short stroll to the beach, cafes, and shopping, it’s easy to see why this building remains so sought-after by both residents and holidaymakers.\r\n\r\nRarely does an apartment of this caliber combine such a beautiful living space with a proven, lucrative income stream. Don’t miss your chance - get in touch today to arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\nNote: The chattels in the photos may vary from what is being sold, please check the chattels list if this is important to you.",
